  "body": "An outstanding opportunity for homeowners and savvy investors! With 2 of the 5 homes already sold, only 3 newly built terraced homes remain. The vendor is motivated and ready to see action!\r\n\r\nFeaturing 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a study, these modern homes combine quality finishes, low-maintenance living and excellent value in one of North Auckland’s fastest-growing locations. Enjoy pleasant outlooks from the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nQuality Features Include:\r\n• Premium Fisher & Paykel kitchen with DishDrawer™, induction cooktop and wall oven\r\n• Hansgrohe tapware and Insinkerator E56 waste disposal\r\n• Full-home HRV system for year-round comfort\r\n• Bright open-plan living, double glazing and smart storage\r\n• Allocated car park plus visitor parking\r\n• Freehold title — no body corporate or residents’ association fees\r\n• 10-year Stamford Warranty\r\n• CCC already issued\r\n\r\nINVESTORS — READY TO GO!\r\nNow tenanted, these properties offer an attractive opportunity for investors seeking rental income and potential long-term capital growth.\r\n\r\nConveniently Located Near:\r\n• Quality schools\r\n• Silverdale Centre, cafés and everyday amenities\r\n• Motorway access and Silverdale Bus Station\r\n• Auckland’s stunning northern beaches\r\n\r\nMOTIVATED VENDOR — URGENT SALE!\r\nWhether you're looking for your next home or a smart investment, don't miss your chance to secure one of these remaining properties.\r\n\r\nContact today for further information and viewing arrangements. Advance notice is required for viewings.",
